# niobespagiftcard.com -> the live checkout, WITHOUT waking the old application.
#
# The client's instinct was to "resuscitate niobespagiftcard.com as it is paid for".
# The domain is worth keeping; the software behind it is not. This file separates the
# two: the domain starts working again as a way in, and every retired surface stays
# exactly as dead as it is today.
#
# It is the retirement .htaccess with ONE rule changed — the last one. Instead of
# landing every request on holding.html, it 301s to the real checkout. Everything
# above that line is byte-for-byte the file that is already deployed and verified,
# and that is deliberate: the gate is the part that must not drift.
#
# What must NOT change, and is asserted by forward.sh after upload:
#   api/       — api/callback.php issued a funded voucher to anyone who posted a
#                plausible pending reference. No signature, no shared secret, and the
#                posted amount was never compared to the order total. It stays 410.
#   backoffice/— admin login whose seed password is printed by a leftover hash.php.
#   cron/      — both scripts email customers AND mutate rows.
#
# 301 and not 302: the move is permanent, and a permanent redirect is the thing that
# gets old links, bookmarks and search results to re-point themselves. A 302 asks
# every visitor to keep coming back here forever.
#
# Retired surfaces are still refused rather than redirected. Handing a bot that is
# probing /api/callback.php a payment page is not an improvement on telling it Gone.

Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex holding.html

<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>
  RewriteEngine On

  # Retired application surfaces — refuse outright, before anything executes.
  RewriteRule ^(api|backoffice|cron)(/|$) - [G,L]

  # Serve the holding page itself and its assets normally, so that reverting to it
  # is one file away and the page is still reachable directly if it is ever needed.
  RewriteRule ^holding\.html$ - [L]
  RewriteRule ^assets/images/logo/ - [L]

  # Everything else now goes to the live checkout instead of the holding page.
  RewriteRule ^ https://pay.niobebeauty.com/gift-card [R=301,L]
</IfModule>

# Belt and braces for hosts where mod_rewrite is unavailable: still no PHP.
<FilesMatch "\.(php|phtml|phar)$">
  Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
